4. Acceptance Testing (UAT) Scenario  Spotify Playlist Feature

1. Verify that the user can create a new playlist successfully.
2. Verify that the user can add songs to the playlist.
3. Verify that the user can remove songs from the playlist.
4. Verify that the user can edit the playlist name.
5. Verify that the playlist is saved successfully after making changes.
6. Verify that the user can play all songs from the created playlist.
7. Verify that the playlist is available after logging out and logging in again.
8. Verify that the user can share the playlist with other users.
9. Verify that the playlist feature is easy to use without any confusion.
10. Verify that the playlist feature meets the user's expectations and works without errors.
